          "text": "This is a detailed 3-day photography-focused itinerary for Kyoto from November 15-17, 2025, designed to capture iconic temples and peak autumn foliage. Each day begins at 6:00 AM to take advantage of the soft morning light and fewer crowds. The schedule balances famous locations with hidden gems and includes estimated transit times to help with planning."
