        {
          "id": "day1_event1_title",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h4",
          "text": "6:00 AM - 7:00 AM: Togetsukyo Bridge & Hozugawa River"
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event1_desc",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Start your day capturing the iconic Togetsukyo Bridge as the morning mist rises from the river. The surrounding mountains will be vibrant with autumn colors."
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event1_tip",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Photographer's Tip: Use a long exposure to smooth the river's surface. The light is soft and indirect."
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event2",
          "component": "Column",
          "children": [
            "day1_event2_title",
            "day1_event2_transit",
            "day1_event2_desc",
            "day1_event2_tip"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event2_title",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h4",
          "text": "7:00 AM - 8:30 AM: Arashiyama Bamboo Grove"
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event2_transit",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Transit: 10 min walk from Togetsukyo Bridge."
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event2_desc",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "This is your best chance to photograph the famous path without crowds. The early light filtering through the tall bamboo stalks creates a magical, ethereal atmosphere."
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event2_tip",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Photographer's Tip: Use a wide-angle lens and shoot upwards to emphasize the height and density of the bamboo."
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event3",
          "component": "Column",
          "children": [
            "day1_event3_title",
            "day1_event3_transit",
            "day1_event3_desc",
            "day1_event3_tip"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event3_title",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h4",
          "text": "8:30 AM - 10:30 AM: Tenryu-ji Temple"
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event3_transit",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Transit: 5 min walk from the Bamboo Grove exit."
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event3_desc",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Explore the temple's magnificent Sogenchi Teien (garden), a UNESCO World Heritage site. The garden's pond reflects the fiery colors of the maples with the Arashiyama mountains as a backdrop."
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event3_tip",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Photographer's Tip: A polarizing filter will be essential to cut glare from the pond and deepen the colors of the sky and foliage."
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event4",
          "component": "Column",
          "children": [
            "day1_event4_title",
            "day1_event4_transit",
            "day1_event4_desc"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event4_title",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h4",
          "text": "10:30 AM - 12:00 PM: Jojakko-ji Temple"
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event4_transit",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Transit: 15 min walk from Tenryu-ji."
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event4_desc",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "This smaller, hillside temple is often less crowded and offers stunning views over Kyoto. The path leading up to the pagoda is covered by a tunnel of brilliant red and orange maple trees."
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event5",
          "component": "Column",
          "children": [
            "day1_event5_title",
            "day1_event5_desc"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event5_title",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h4",
          "text": "12:00 PM - 2:00 PM: Lunch & Transit to Kinkaku-ji"
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event5_desc",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Enjoy lunch in Arashiyama. Afterward, take a taxi or a combination of the Randen tram and a bus to Kinkaku-ji.\nTransit: Approx. 45-60 min."
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event6",
          "component": "Column",
          "children": [
            "day1_event6_title",
            "day1_event6_desc",
            "day1_event6_tip"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event6_title",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h4",
          "text": "2:00 PM - 3:30 PM: Kinkaku-ji (Golden Pavilion)"
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event6_desc",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "The afternoon sun illuminates the gold leaf of the pavilion, creating a brilliant reflection in the surrounding pond. This is the classic shot, but it will be crowded."
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event6_tip",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Photographer's Tip: Find a spot to the side of the main viewing area for a slightly different composition with foliage framing the pavilion."
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event7",
          "component": "Column",
          "children": [
            "day1_event7_title",
            "day1_event7_transit",
            "day1_event7_desc"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event7_title",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h4",
          "text": "3:30 PM - 5:00 PM: Ryoan-ji Temple"
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event7_transit",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Transit: 20 min walk or 5 min bus ride from Kinkaku-ji."
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event7_desc",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Capture the serene and minimalist beauty of Japan's most famous rock garden. The abstract patterns and raked gravel offer a different kind of photographic challenge."
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event8",
          "component": "Column",
          "children": [
            "day1_event8_title",
            "day1_event8_desc"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event8_title",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h4",
          "text": "Evening: Dinner in Gion"
        },
        {
          "id": "day1_event8_desc",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Transit: Approx. 40 min by bus.\nExplore the historic Gion district, capturing the traditional wooden machiya houses and lantern-lit streets."
        },
