          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h4",
          "text": "6:00 AM - 8:30 AM: Kiyomizu-dera Temple"
        },
        {
          "id": "day2_event1_desc",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Arrive right at opening to see the main wooden stage with the city of Kyoto below, bathed in sunrise colors. The temple grounds have many maple trees perfect for early morning shots."
        },
        {
          "id": "day2_event1_tip",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Photographer's Tip: The best viewpoint is from the Okunoin Hall, looking back at the main stage."
        },
        {
